BT /F1 24 Tf 72 740 Td (Wind-down plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 700 Td (For Jordan Reyes, from Maya Okafor, LPC. Session 3, Sleep and evening routines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 660 Td (Start winding down 30 minutes before bed:) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 640 Td (1. Check tomorrow's shifts once, then close the shift app for the night.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 620 Td (2. Leave your phone outside the bedroom on work nights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 600 Td (3. Dim the lights and do something calm: read, stretch, or listen to music.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 580 Td (4. Once you're in bed, try box breathing: in for 4, hold for 4, out for 4, hold for 4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 540 Td (If you're still awake after about 20 minutes, get up, keep the lights low,) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 520 Td (and go back to bed when you feel sleepy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 480 Td (Each morning, note how long it took to fall asleep. We'll look at it together.) Tj ET
endstream
